The `mktemp -t handoff-XXXXXX.md` instruction makes Claude create a temp file literally called `handoff-XXXXXX.md`. I edited the skill and replaced it with `handoff-{human-readable-session-name}.md` and it worked.

// EDIT
Alternatively, use `handoff-{session-human-readable-name}-$(openssl rand -hex 4).md` to avoid collisions.
